window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a world where magic courses through the veins of its wielders, twenty-seven-year-old Layla Valentine is on the brink of graduation from the prestigious Reigner Academy. As the daughter of the kingdom’s general, she makes a choice that forever alters her fate, sending her on a perilous journey where old feuds clash and new alliances form.</p> <p>Crimson Shadow weaves a tapestry of action, heartache, and fiery romance, exploring the bonds of family, the cost of freedom, and the thin line between enemy and ally. As shadowy secrets unfold and the stakes soar, will Layla’s fierce loyalty for her brother drive her toward salvation, or plunge her deeper into despair? Will her encounter with a sworn enemy be the flame amidst the darkness, or the shadow that swallows her whole?</p> <p>Join Layla on this spellbinding journey that promises to captivate the hearts of its readers. Discover if she has the strength to defy her fate and reclaim her life amidst the shadows.</p>"; 
